<section id="about" class="pt-32 pb-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:gap-16">
      <div class="shrink-0">
        <img
          src="/img/avatar.jpg"
          alt="Christian Roerig"
          class="h-36 w-36 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-zinc-100 dark:ring-zinc-800"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
            Christian Roerig
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-1 text-lg text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Data Scientist & University Lecturer
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">
            QuantCo & University of Cambridge
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
          I am an economist by training and received my PhD from the University of
          Cambridge in 2021. I work as a data scientist at QuantCo and teach Fundamentals
          of Data Science as part of the MPhil in Economics and Data Science at the University of Cambridge. My research interests are
          in macroeconomics, firm dynamics, and causal inference using machine learning.
        </p>
